    "body": "OK, the URL is quite clear, by step 21: \"Change the document's address to the address of the responsible document specified by the entry settings object.\"\n\nHow about the base URL, origin, and these things? As far as I can tell, that's all in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#set-up-a-browsing-context-environment-settings-object and it's using the Document associated with the global object (a Window). Is that necessarily the same as the entry settings object's responsible document?\n",
