    "body": "> As the spec is written right this second, it's using the document associated with the global the open function came from, since it's using the \"realm execution context\". I don't think that's a sane thing to do here. @domenic, thoughts?\n\nI guess I would expect it to use the \"this\" value as the source document. But nobody seems to be proposing that...?\n",
